ender","hash_xxh64":"0x0035D96BA2590895","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"このリーフベアーが……あ、あり得ません！","female":"このリーフベアーが……あ、あり得ません！","variant_male_record_index":"145492","variant_female_record_index":"145493","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320113011:1":{"text":"まさか、人間の姿から入れ替わったと！？","source_cn":"真的是人变的吗！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9AE32231C3EF58ED","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"まさか、人間の姿から入れ替わったと！？","female":"まさか、人間の姿から入れ替わったと！？","variant_male_record_index":"145494","variant_female_record_index":"145495","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320113012:1":{"text":"クマさん……本当に人間だったの？","source_cn":"叶角熊……你原本是人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEFC792B57222CDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320113013:1":{"text":"もしそうなら、頷いてください。","source_cn":"是的话，你就点点头。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF1F929610E462B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320113014:0":{"text":"グォ……","source_cn":"呜……<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x757EE9C1431337BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320113015:1":{"text":"でもいったいどうやって！","source_cn":"你怎么变成叶角熊了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCE5F78733199C15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:17:1320113016:0":{"text":"このリーフベアーは本当に人間なのか？それを確かめるため、あなたたちは魔法で彼を元の姿に戻すことにした……","source_cn":"这只叶角熊居然是个人？！这可真是奇怪……你们准备施法将...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7DE6F79520786A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:23:13020132:0":{"text":"あなたの魔法で、リーフベアーに変身した人間を元の姿に戻した。","source_cn":"你用魔法试着解除叶角熊身上的变形术，果然将他变回了人类。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D8840F17507DAA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"そう、人間だ。","source_cn":"是人变的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB24F3DC94227B9D6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"そう、人間だ。","female":"そう、人間よ。","variant_male_record_index":"68850","variant_female_record_index":"68851","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"思い切って言ってみろ。","source_cn":"大胆一点，说出来","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x772C4D5AC09E0DE5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"思い切って言ってみろ。","female":"思い切って言ってみるのよ。","variant_male_record_index":"68852","variant_female_record_index":"68853","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"みんな、これは大胆な発想かもしれないが……","source_cn":"诸位，我有一个大胆的想法","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x75188C7C7A0